        "size": 12735378
      },
      "features": [
        "**Updates page rebuilt to match the approved design.** Coloured release-count pills (features, fixes, optimizations), a timeline rail with Pre-release and Latest badges, per-category cards with a coloured icon and count, and stacked GitHub and Download actions.",
        "**Manual Check for update on every state.** The button forces a real network check that bypasses the cache, shows a busy state, and reports the outcome. Pull-to-refresh works as well.",
        "**Restore from backup during setup.** The services step now offers a Restore from backup card above the toggles, so a returning user never has to finish setup and dig through Settings.",
        "**No services selected prompt.** Tapping Continue with nothing enabled explains that a backup can bring services, URLs and keys straight back, with Restore from backup and Set up services manually as explicit choices."
      ],
      "fixes": [
        "**Update downloads no longer fail with 404.** Release manifests pointed the APK and IPA at the private source repository, which returns 404 without authentication; asset URLs now target the public mirror.",
        "**Release notes render proper bold text.** Literal `**` markers were shown verbatim in the timeline; emphasis is now rendered and stray markers stripped.",
        "**A cached result is never presented as a confirmed up-to-date state.** When the server cannot be reached the page says so and shows when it last checked.",
        "**Successful wishlist submits no longer appear as FAILED.** Provenance is no longer written as a failure reason.",
        "**Submits are no longer locked to a single music provider.** The app uses whatever track identity the server returns.",
        "**Requests no longer empty themselves after a submit.**",
        "**The iOS app icon ships again,** declared as bundle icons so it works without an asset-catalog compiler."
      ],
      "optimizations": [
        "**Release manifest regeneration targets the public mirror for every asset,** and the manifest is rebuilt in full on each release instead of appended to."
      ],
      "droppedCount": 0,
      "notesHash": "85af34a9554bf81239f6edca06f633dc5a6a228e7bf223736a1197811ae6b905"
    },
